    "description": {
      "value": "<p class=\"feature\"><em>Dexterity Saving Throw:</em> DC [[lookup @save.dc.value activity=hvGQg4CsoCNgrjGy]], each creature in a [[lookup @target.template.size activity=hvGQg4CsoCNgrjGy]]-[[lookup @target.template.units activity=hvGQg4CsoCNgrjGy]]. [[lookup @target.template.type capitalize activity=hvGQg4CsoCNgrjGy]]</p><p class=\"feature\"><em>Failure:</em> [[/damage average]] damage.</p><p class=\"feature\"><em>Success:</em> Half damage.</p><p class=\"feature\"><em>Failure or Success:</em> A Humanoid reduced to 0 Hit Points by this damage dies, and a <strong>@UUID[Compendium.dnd-monster-manual.actors.Actor.mmShadow00000000]{Shadow} </strong>rises from its corpse. The shadow is under the [[lookup @name lowercase]]’s control and shares the [[lookup @name lowercase]]’s Initiative count but acts immediately after the [[lookup @name lowercase]].</p>",
